<title>POLAND: Elektrim 9.8 pct drop surprises traders.</title>
<headline>Elektrim 9.8 pct drop surprises traders.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trading and industrial conglomerate Elektrim SA plunged 9.8 percent to 23 zlotys in a 9.8-million-zloty turnover on Thursday but traders said they could not explain the drop.</p>
<p>&quot;I can't think of any information that could have caused such a fall. Basically, I think the drop has provided a good occasion to buy the stock,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
